    "created_at": "2016-09-23T10:24:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-23T10:24:29Z",
    "body": "This is very related to https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/1087. As I stated there, we don't specify UI in the spec, so implementations can use label, value, or both if they want for display. There's the separate question of how searches are performed, and there's not much agreement there.\n",
