    "created_at": "2016-09-26T09:09:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T09:09:36Z",
    "body": "Yeah, this is very much up to each user agent to decide what the optimal UI is for their users. I do hope that over time as we learn more we can add some guidance to the specification and converge implementations as otherwise developers will just end up using libraries with deterministic behavior instead.\n",
